stack1 = [10, 20, 30]
stack2 = [30, 40, 50]
with concat ichiga qoshvoradi tipo 1,2,3 qilib
[10, 20, 30, 30, 40, 50]
Union      → birlashtirish
concat()   → Stacklarni birlashtiradi
filter()   → kerakli elementlarni ajratadi
indexOf()  → birinchi indexni topadi
Duplicate  → takrorlangan qiymat
